---

<Layout
  title="Careers | Cliffco Mortgage Bankers"
  description="Join Cliffco Mortgage Bankers, a collaborative, growth-focused team of loan officers and mortgage professionals. View open positions and apply today."
>
  <Breadcrumbs trail={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Careers", href: "/careers/" },
  ]} />

  <StoryHero eyebrow="Careers" marker="Why join">
    Join a team that gets<br class="hidden sm:block"/> people home.
    <Fragment slot="lead">
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-[var(--color-text)]" style="font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.65;">
        At Cliffco, we surround ourselves with people who have an appetite for success. Loan officers
        here don't compete against each other. They share blueprints, lift each other up, and win
        together. If that sounds like your kind of team, keep reading.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <a href="#loan-officers" class="btn btn-primary">For Loan Officers</a>
      <a href="#corporate" class="btn btn-secondary">For Corporate Roles</a>
    </Fragment>
  </StoryHero>

  <!-- THE CLIFFCO DIFFERENCE -->
  <TimelineItem
    marker="Culture"
    title="A different kind of culture."
    intro="Our operations team and leadership are laser-focused on collaboration and transparency. We're changemakers: people who provide real solutions and use technology to stay ahead of the market."
  >
    <div class="grid xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-10 items-start">
      <ol class="list-none m-0 p-0 border-t-2 border-[var(--color-ink)]">
        <li class="py-5 border-b border-black/15">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]">Collaborative by design</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
            Loan officers share strategies, not just leads. Leadership is accessible. The people
            at the top built their books the same way you will.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="py-5 border-b border-black/15">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]">Built for producers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
            Marketing, technology, training, and a full product stack: everything a high-producing
            LO needs is already here. You focus on relationships; we handle the rest.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="py-5 border-b border-black/15">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]">Real growth, real results</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
            We celebrate wins, individually and as a team. Your growth is the whole point.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <img src="/images/content%20images/Careers.jpg" alt="Cliffco team" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </TimelineItem>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <TimelineItem marker="Values" title="What we stand for.">
    <dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 border-t-2 border-[var(--color-ink)]">
      {values.map((v) => (
        <div class="py-4 border-b border-black/15">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink)]">{v.name}</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text)]">{v.desc}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </TimelineItem>

  <!-- LO BENEFITS -->
  <TimelineItem
    id="loan-officers"
    marker="Loan officers"
    eyebrow="For loan officers"
    title="Everything you need to produce."
    intro="A seasoned LO looking for a better platform, or a branch manager ready to bring your team: this is what you get on day one."
  >
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
      {loBenefits.map((b, i) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-[var(--color-ink)] p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">0{i + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]">{b.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed flex-1">{b.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-6 justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Loan officer or branch manager?</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-white/70 text-sm">Send your resume and we'll set up a conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:employment@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-primary !bg-white !text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:!bg-white/85 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Apply Now</a>
    </div>
  </TimelineItem>

  <!-- CORPORATE ROLES -->
  <TimelineItem id="corporate" marker="Corporate" eyebrow="Corporate and operations" title="Behind every great LO is a great team.">
    <div class="grid xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-10 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">
          Our operations team is the backbone of Cliffco. From processors and underwriters to
          marketers and compliance professionals. Every role matters, and everyone is invested
          in getting borrowers across the finish line.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">
          If you're interested in a career in mortgage operations, corporate administration,
          or any of the roles below, we'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:hr@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-primary mt-6 inline-block">Apply Now</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
        {corporateRoles.map((role) => (
          <li class="rounded-xl border-2 border-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] text-center">{role.name}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </TimelineItem>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <TimelineItem marker="Apply" title="We are hiring loan officers and operations talent." intro="Two ways in. One culture. Tell us who you are and what you do best." dark last>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="mailto:employment@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-primary !bg-white !text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:!bg-white/85">Loan Officers</a>
      <a href="mailto:hr@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-secondary !border-white !text-white">Corporate Roles</a>
    </div>
  </TimelineItem>
</Layout>
